<title>UK: Heywood Williams operating profit up 27 pct.</title>
<headline>Heywood Williams operating profit up 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.0		    vs 17.5</p>
<p> Shr pre-exceptionals   10.6		   vs 8.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.0		    vs same</p>
<p> Pretax		     15.31		  vs 24.02</p>
<p> Operating profit	 17.57		  vs 13.80</p>
<p> Turnover		   310.77		 vs 264.49</p>
<p>NOTE - Pretax profit for the building and automotive products group is before exceptional losses of 1.9 million stg as against exceptional gains of 9.9 million in 1995.</p>
<p> Interest charge	  0.42		   vs gain 0.29</p>
<p> Tax			  5.52		   vs 4.79</p>
<p> Net taxed		  9.80		   vs 19.23</p>
<p> Attributable	     9.65		   vs 18.84</p>
<p> Pay date		   October 18</p>
<p>Div registration date  October 1  Ex-div date		September 23</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
